# Sample API Requests for eCommerce Demo
# Use with REST Client extension in VS Code or import into Postman

### Variables
@orderServiceUrl = http://localhost:5001
@paymentServiceUrl = http://localhost:5002

### Create Order - Success Scenario
POST {{orderServiceUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-001",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "LAPTOP-XPS15",
      "productName": "Dell XPS 15",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 1299.99
    }
  ],
  "totalAmount": 1299.99,
  "shippingAddress": {
    "street": "123 Tech Street",
    "city": "San Francisco",
    "state": "CA",
    "zipCode": "94105",
    "country": "USA"
  }
}

### Create Order - Multiple Items
POST {{orderServiceUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-002",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "PHONE-IPHONE15",
      "productName": "iPhone 15 Pro",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 999.99
    },
    {
      "productId": "CASE-LEATHER",
      "productName": "Leather Case",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 49.99
    }
  ],
  "totalAmount": 2099.96,
  "shippingAddress": {
    "street": "456 Mobile Ave",
    "city": "New York",
    "state": "NY",
    "zipCode": "10001",
    "country": "USA"
  }
}

### Create Order - High Value
POST {{orderServiceUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-VIP-001",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "MACBOOK-PRO",
      "productName": "MacBook Pro 16-inch",
      "quantity": 5,
      "unitPrice": 2499.99
    }
  ],
  "totalAmount": 12499.95,
  "shippingAddress": {
    "street": "789 Enterprise Blvd",
    "city": "Seattle",
    "state": "WA",
    "zipCode": "98101",
    "country": "USA"
  }
}

### Cancel Order (replace {orderId} with actual order ID)
POST {{orderServiceUrl}}/api/orders/{orderId}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Customer requested cancellation"
}

### Get Order Status (replace {orderId} with actual order ID)
GET {{orderServiceUrl}}/api/orders/{orderId}

### Health Check - Order Service
GET {{orderServiceUrl}}/health

### Health Check - Payment Service
GET {{paymentServiceUrl}}/health

### Create 10 Orders (for testing payment failures - ~1 will fail)
# This demonstrates the 90% success rate and saga compensation

POST {{orderServiceUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-TEST-001",
  "items": [{"productId": "TEST-001", "productName": "Test Product", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 99.99}],
  "totalAmount": 99.99,
  "shippingAddress": {"street": "Test St", "city": "Test City", "state": "CA", "zipCode": "12345", "country": "USA"}
}

